  "usage": [
    "Use 等於 to say two amounts, numbers, or expressions are the same.",
    "It often appears in math, for example when you compare one side and the other side of an equation.",
    "You can also use it more loosely in daily speech to mean 'is the same as' or 'means'.",
    "The pattern is usually A 等於 B, with the thing on the left and the result on the right."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "dang2jyu4-equal-example-1",
      "sentence": "二加三等於五。",
